menu "Smart lock v5"

config SMARTLOCK_USB_POWERED
    bool "USB-powered version (no battery)"
    default n
    help
        The PCB's R13 links USB 5 V to the battery rail, there is no pouch. The lock reports a wired power
        source instead of a battery level, and Thread runs as a router (sdkconfig.defaults.usb).

endmenu
